<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN WOMENS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PAN PACIFIC OPEN WOMENS RESULTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>TOKYO, Jan 28 (Reuter) First round results on Tuesday in the</p>
<p>Pan</p>
<p>Pacific Open women's tennis tournament (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Lisa Raymond (U.S) beat Seda Noorlander (Netherlands) 7-5</p>
<p>6-7 (3-7) 7-5</p>
<p>Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Alexia Dechalme-Balleret (France)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 6-7 (2-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Kristie Boogert (Netherlands) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 6-2</p>
<p>4-6 6-4</p>
<p>8-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Ruxandra Dragomir</p>
<p>(Romania) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Wang Shi-ting (Taiwan) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus)</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) beat Rika Hiraki (Japan) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>4-6 7-6 (7-5)</p>
</text>
